-redirect">RIKEN</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Thesis" title="Thesis">Thesis</a></th><td class="infobox-data"><i><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20140221023150/http://dspace.wul.waseda.ac.jp/dspace/handle/2065/36341" class="external text">Isolation of pluripotent adult stem cells discovered from tissues derived from all three germ layers</a></i><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:97%;">(2011 (revoked in 2015))</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; "><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="./Doctoral_advisor" title="Doctoral advisor">Doctoral advisor</a></div></th><td class="infobox-data">Satoshi Tsuneda<sup about="#mwt16" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-FreeWay_2-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"FreeWay"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-FreeWay-2"}}'><a href="./Haruko_Obokata#cite_note-FreeWay-2" id="mwDQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDw">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEA">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr><tr style="display:none"><td colspan="2">
